    "%@%@ 正从该盘运行，现在拔盘会当场崩溃。退出这些应用后再弹出": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%@ is running from this drive. Ejecting now would crash it. Quit those apps, then eject"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%@ 正从该盘运行，现在拔盘会当场崩溃。退出这些应用后再弹出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移任务正在搬走该盘上的应用，中途拔盘会留下半截副本。等任务结束后再弹出": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A move is copying an app off this drive. Ejecting now would leave a partial copy. Wait until it finishes"
