        }
      }
    },
    "更新源返回了非 HTTP 响应。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The update feed didn’t return an HTTP response."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新源返回了非 HTTP 响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n            更新源返回 404：%@\n            最常见的原因是仓库为私有（Sparkle 拉 feed 时不带任何凭证，GitHub 对匿名请求\n            一律返回 404），或者还没有发布过任何正式 Release。两种情况 Sparkle 都拿不到 appcast。\n            ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The update feed returned 404: %@\n\nThe usual causes are a private repository (Sparkle fetches the feed with no credentials, and GitHub answers anonymous requests with 404) or no public release yet. Either way Sparkle can’t read the appcast."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n            更新源返回 404：%@\n            最常见的原因是仓库为私有（Sparkle 拉 feed 时不带任何凭证，GitHub 对匿名请求\n            一律返回 404），或者还没有发布过任何正式 Release。两种情况 Sparkle 都拿不到 appcast。\n            "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新源返回 HTTP %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The update feed returned HTTP %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新源返回 HTTP %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法连接更新源：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t reach the update feed: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接更新源：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动更新尚未启用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic updates aren’t set up"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动更新尚未启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n                当前安装包里没有更新公钥（Info.plist 的 SUPublicEDKey），\n                所以无法校验更新包。\n\n                公钥来自仓库根目录的 sparkle_public_key.txt，由 build.sh 在构建时写入。\n                用 bash build.sh 重新构建安装即可带上；在此之前，升级方式就是重新构建。\n                ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build has no update public key (SUPublicEDKey in Info.plist), so update packages can’t be verified.\n\nThe key comes from sparkle_public_key.txt and is written by build.sh. Rebuild with bash build.sh to include it. Until then, upgrade by rebuilding."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n                当前安装包里没有更新公钥（Info.plist 的 SUPublicEDKey），\n                所以无法校验更新包。\n\n                公钥来自仓库根目录的 sparkle_public_key.txt，由 build.sh 在构建时写入。\n                用 bash build.sh 重新构建安装即可带上；在此之前，升级方式就是重新构建。\n                "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新源暂时不可用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update feed unavailable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新源暂时不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n                    %@\n\n                    这不影响当前版本的使用。也可以到项目的 Releases 页面手动下载新版安装包。\n                    ": {
