    "\n        「%@」正在%@，\n        现在强制退出可能留下半完成状态（原件和备份都在，可通过体检页恢复）。\n        建议等待完成，通常只需几十秒。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is %@.\n\nQuitting now can leave a half-finished state (the original and the backup are both still there, and Health can recover them). Wait for it to finish — usually under a minute."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        「%@」正在%@，\n        现在强制退出可能留下半完成状态（原件和备份都在，可通过体检页恢复）。\n        建议等待完成，通常只需几十秒。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
