    "目标路径落在内置盘上（目标卷未挂载？），已阻止迁移以免数据写入内置盘": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That path is on the internal drive (is the destination volume unmounted?). The move was blocked so nothing is written there by mistake."
          }
        },
