          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目标是网络共享/云盘卷：共享断线后所有链接会失效，不能用于存放应用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That destination is a network or cloud volume. If the share drops, every link breaks. It can’t hold apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标是网络共享/云盘卷：共享断线后所有链接会失效，不能用于存放应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目标是只读卷，无法写入": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That volume is read-only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标是只读卷，无法写入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目标是 Time Machine 备份盘，系统空间紧张时会自动清理其中的旧备份，不能用于存放应用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That volume is a Time Machine backup disk. macOS can delete old backups when space is low, so it can’t hold apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标是 Time Machine 备份盘，系统空间紧张时会自动清理其中的旧备份，不能用于存放应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目标盘是 exFAT 格式：应用包内的软链接在 exFAT 上会损坏，无法迁移。请备份数据后在「磁盘工具」中将该盘抹为 APFS 再试": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That volume is ExFAT. Symbolic links inside an app bundle break on ExFAT. Back up the disk, then erase it as APFS in Disk Utility and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标盘是 exFAT 格式：应用包内的软链接在 exFAT 上会损坏，无法迁移。请备份数据后在「磁盘工具」中将该盘抹为 APFS 再试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目标盘空间不足：%@ 的应用需要约 %@，仅剩 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not enough space for %@. About %@ is required, and %@ is free."
