      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not enough space for %@. About %@ is required, including the on-disk backup, and %@ is free."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标盘空间不足：%@ 的应用需要约 %@（含同盘留底备份），仅剩 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份盘空间不足：%@ 的应用需要约 %@ 备份空间，备份盘仅剩 %@。可在设置 → 备份 → 备份存放位置中更换备份盘，或清理该盘空间": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not enough space on the backup drive for %@. About %@ is required for the backup, and %@ is free. Change the backup location in Settings → Backup, or free some space."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份盘空间不足：%@ 的应用需要约 %@ 备份空间，备份盘仅剩 %@。可在设置 → 备份 → 备份存放位置中更换备份盘，或清理该盘空间"
          }
