          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪映草稿与素材"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪映 → 左上角「剪映专业版」菜单 → 全局设置 → 草稿位置，改到外置盘上的文件夹，剪映会自己把草稿搬过去。素材随草稿走，无需建链接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Jianying, choose Jianying Pro → Settings → Draft Location, and pick a folder on the external drive. Jianying moves the drafts itself. Media travels with the drafts, so no link is needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪映 → 左上角「剪映专业版」菜单 → 全局设置 → 草稿位置，改到外置盘上的文件夹，剪映会自己把草稿搬过去。素材随草稿走，无需建链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
