    "Xcode 派生数据": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode Derived Data"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode 派生数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "纯缓存，可整个删掉（Xcode 下次构建自动重建，项目索引会重跑）。想保留就 Xcode → Settings → Locations → Derived Data 改自定义路径到外置盘。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a cache. You can delete the whole folder — Xcode rebuilds it next time, and project indexes run again. To keep it, set a custom Derived Data path on the external drive in Xcode → Settings → Locations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纯缓存，可整个删掉（Xcode 下次构建自动重建，项目索引会重跑）。想保留就 Xcode → Settings → Locations → Derived Data 改自定义路径到外置盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "纯缓存，删了也无损": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cache only — deleting it loses nothing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纯缓存，删了也无损"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam 游戏库": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam library"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 游戏库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam → 设置 → 存储 → 添加外置盘上的库文件夹，再把已装游戏「移动」过去。不要直接搬整个 Steam 目录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Steam, choose Settings → Storage, add a library folder on the external drive, then Move installed games. Don’t move the whole Steam folder by hand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam → 设置 → 存储 → 添加外置盘上的库文件夹，再把已装游戏「移动」过去。不要直接搬整个 Steam 目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "微信聊天记录与文件": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat chats and files"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信聊天记录与文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n                微信 → 设置 → 通用 → 文件存储位置 → 更改，选外置盘上的文件夹，微信会自己把聊天记录搬过去。\n\n                ⚠️ 想清楚再搬：聊天记录是每天要读写的热数据，搬外置盘后每次刷消息都走外置盘；盘没插时微信打不开历史。权衡后觉得值再动手。\n                ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In WeChat, choose Settings → General → File Storage → Change, and pick a folder on the external drive. WeChat moves the chat history itself.\n\nThink twice: chats are read and written all day, so they will use the external drive. If the drive isn’t connected, WeChat can’t open history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n                微信 → 设置 → 通用 → 文件存储位置 → 更改，选外置盘上的文件夹，微信会自己把聊天记录搬过去。\n\n                ⚠️ 想清楚再搬：聊天记录是每天要读写的热数据，搬外置盘后每次刷消息都走外置盘；盘没插时微信打不开历史。权衡后觉得值再动手。\n                "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天记录是日常热数据，搬前想清楚；沙盒受保护，此处体积可能显示为未知": {
