          }
        }
      }
    },
    "既然不常用，搬回内置盘把外置盘空间腾出来": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you don’t use it, move it back and free the external drive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "既然不常用，搬回内置盘把外置盘空间腾出来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数据来自系统记录的最近使用时间。若关闭了这块盘的 Spotlight 索引，系统会停止记账，此处以后将不再出现建议。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Based on the last-used time macOS records. If Spotlight indexing is off for this drive, macOS stops recording it and this suggestion will disappear."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据来自系统记录的最近使用时间。若关闭了这块盘的 Spotlight 索引，系统会停止记账，此处以后将不再出现建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开机自启指向外置盘": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Login items point at the external drive"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开机自启指向外置盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盘没插时这些自启会失败，守护项更是开机必失败": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These fail when the drive isn’t connected. Launch agents fail at every startup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "盘没插时这些自启会失败，守护项更是开机必失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
