    "恢复后这块盘重新参与 Spotlight 搜索（会重新全盘扫描一段时间）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This drive will show up in Spotlight again. macOS will reindex it for a while."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复后这块盘重新参与 Spotlight 搜索（会重新全盘扫描一段时间）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这块盘不参与 Spotlight 搜索，不再被后台扫描（省电护盘）。想恢复随时点上面的按钮。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This drive is excluded from Spotlight and isn’t scanned in the background. Turn indexing back on above whenever you want."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这块盘不参与 Spotlight 搜索，不再被后台扫描（省电护盘）。想恢复随时点上面的按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复这块盘的 Spotlight 索引？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn Spotlight indexing back on for this drive?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复这块盘的 Spotlight 索引？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭这块盘的 Spotlight 索引？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn Spotlight indexing off for this drive?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭这块盘的 Spotlight 索引？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复后 Spotlight 会重新扫描整块盘（期间盘会持续读写），盘上内容重新可被搜索。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spotlight will scan the whole drive again. It will be busy reading and writing for a while, and files on the drive will be searchable again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复后 Spotlight 会重新扫描整块盘（期间盘会持续读写），盘上内容重新可被搜索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，这块盘上的内容不再出现在 Spotlight 搜索结果里，搜索也不再混入外置盘副本；后台扫描停止。想恢复随时可以再来这里操作。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files on this drive will no longer appear in Spotlight, and the extra external-drive copies won’t show up in search. Background scanning stops. You can turn it back on here later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，这块盘上的内容不再出现在 Spotlight 搜索结果里，搜索也不再混入外置盘副本；后台扫描停止。想恢复随时可以再来这里操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
