    "把这个文件夹搬到外置盘？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move this folder to the external drive?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这个文件夹搬到外置盘？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n        %@\n\n        将复制到外置盘、校验后在原位置建链接指回外置盘，原件留底可回滚。\n        迁移前请确认没有程序正在往这个文件夹写数据。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nIt will be copied to the external drive. After verification, a link is left in the original place, and the original is kept so it can be restored.\n\nMake sure nothing is writing to this folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        %@\n\n        将复制到外置盘、校验后在原位置建链接指回外置盘，原件留底可回滚。\n        迁移前请确认没有程序正在往这个文件夹写数据。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始迁移": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Move"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始迁移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移 自选 · %@...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving custom folder %@…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "迁移 自选 · %@..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」搬迁指引": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How to move “%@”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」搬迁指引"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n让应用自己搬最稳：不建链接、升级不怕、拔盘不分叉。搬完回到这里重新扫描，确认旧位置已清空。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nLetting the app move its own data is the safest option: no link, updates don’t undo it, and unplugging the drive doesn’t split the data. When it’s done, rescan here and confirm the old location is empty."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n让应用自己搬最稳：不建链接、升级不怕、拔盘不分叉。搬完回到这里重新扫描，确认旧位置已清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开应用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open App"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移「%@」到外置硬盘": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move “%@” to an external drive?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "迁移「%@」到外置硬盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n        将复制 %@ 到外置盘，校验通过后在原位置建链接，原件留底可回滚。\n        请确认相关应用当前没有正在写入数据。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %@ will be copied to the external drive. After verification, a link is left in the original place, and the original is kept so it can be restored.\n\nMake sure the app isn’t writing data right now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        将复制 %@ 到外置盘，校验通过后在原位置建链接，原件留底可回滚。\n        请确认相关应用当前没有正在写入数据。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移 %@...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving %@…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "迁移 %@..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把「%@」回迁到内置盘？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move “%@” back to the internal drive?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把「%@」回迁到内置盘？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n        将删除原位置的链接，把外置盘上的数据复制回内置盘，校验通过后清理外置副本。\n        回迁期间请勿使用相关应用（属主应用正在运行时，工具会直接拒绝回迁）。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link will be removed, the data will be copied back to the internal drive, and the external copy will be deleted after verification.\n\nDon’t use the related app while this runs. If it’s running, the move is refused."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        将删除原位置的链接，把外置盘上的数据复制回内置盘，校验通过后清理外置副本。\n        回迁期间请勿使用相关应用（属主应用正在运行时，工具会直接拒绝回迁）。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始回迁": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Move Back"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始回迁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数据分叉处置": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data in two places"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据分叉处置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n        将把本地重建的「%@」改名隔离（保留在原地），链接恢复指向外置盘正本。\n        如果你离线期间产生的数据更重要，请先手动备份，或选择暂不处置。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local copy of “%@” that was recreated offline will be renamed and left in place. The link will point at the external original again.\n\nIf the data you created while offline matters more, back it up first, or skip this."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        将把本地重建的「%@」改名隔离（保留在原地），链接恢复指向外置盘正本。\n        如果你离线期间产生的数据更重要，请先手动备份，或选择暂不处置。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以外置盘为准": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep External Copy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以外置盘为准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
