    "删除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个应用在内置盘和外置盘的应用目录里都不存在了（已卸载），这份迁移前备份已经没有用处。删除会移入废纸篓，可恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app is gone from both the internal drive and the external Applications folder, so this pre-move backup is useless. Deleting it moves it to the Trash, where you can restore it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个应用在内置盘和外置盘的应用目录里都不存在了（已卸载），这份迁移前备份已经没有用处。删除会移入废纸篓，可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是迁移「%@」时留的底，已超过保留期。只要应用还能正常打开就可以删。删除会移入废纸篓，可恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the backup kept when “%@” was moved, and it’s past the retention period. If the app still opens normally, you can delete it. Deleting moves it to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是迁移「%@」时留的底，已超过保留期。只要应用还能正常打开就可以删。删除会移入废纸篓，可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已卸载应用残留": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
