    "该目录体积 ≥100MB，且没有任何已安装应用认领它——判断为已卸载应用的残留数据。\n位置：%@\n不确定是什么时，可先点「显示」去 Finder 里看看再决定。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This folder is 100 MB or larger, and no installed app claims it, so it’s treated as leftover data.\nLocation: %@\nIf you aren’t sure, click Show and look in Finder before you delete it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该目录体积 ≥100MB，且没有任何已安装应用认领它——判断为已卸载应用的残留数据。\n位置：%@\n不确定是什么时，可先点「显示」去 Finder 里看看再决定。"
          }
        }
      }
