            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 个是 App Store 应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n        %@%@。\n\n        它们更适合用行内的「纯搬迁」（不留链接）：不留链接时 App Store 更新会就地写到\n        外置盘上（本机实测），搬迁不会被撤销。而这里的一键迁移用的是「留链接」，\n        更新有可能把链接换成真目录。\n\n        其余 %lld 个可以正常一键迁移。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%@.\n\nThese are better moved with “Move Without Link” on the row. Without a link, the App Store updates the copy on the external drive in place (confirmed locally), so the move isn’t undone. Move All leaves a link, and an update might replace that link with a real folder.\n\nThe other %lld can use Move All."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        %@%@。\n\n        它们更适合用行内的「纯搬迁」（不留链接）：不留链接时 App Store 更新会就地写到\n        外置盘上（本机实测），搬迁不会被撤销。而这里的一键迁移用的是「留链接」，\n        更新有可能把链接换成真目录。\n\n        其余 %lld 个可以正常一键迁移。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
