    },
    "把「%@」上的内容全部迁回内置盘？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move everything on “%@” back to the internal drive?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把「%@」上的内容全部迁回内置盘？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n            将逐项迁回（共 %lld 项，约 %@）：\n            · 链接迁移应用 %lld 个\n            · 外置盘原住民应用 %lld 个\n            · 数据目录（含自选）%lld 个\n\n            正在运行的应用会被跳过并在最后汇报。全部成功后可选择清掉盘上的随手迁目录。\n            ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each item will be moved back (%lld items, about %@):\n· %lld apps moved with a link\n· %lld apps that live on the external drive\n· %lld data folders (including ones you chose)\n\nApps that are running are skipped and listed at the end. When everything succeeds, you can remove Suishouqian’s folders from the drive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n            将逐项迁回（共 %lld 项，约 %@）：\n            · 链接迁移应用 %lld 个\n            · 外置盘原住民应用 %lld 个\n            · 数据目录（含自选）%lld 个\n\n            正在运行的应用会被跳过并在最后汇报。全部成功后可选择清掉盘上的随手迁目录。\n            "
          }
        }
      }
    },
