    "\n            在所有已挂载硬盘上都没有找到「%@」，更新缓存里也没有可恢复的新版本。\n\n            %@。请插入对应硬盘、重新安装该应用，或手动回迁。\n            ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” wasn’t found on any connected drive, and the update cache has no version to restore.\n\n%@. Connect the drive, reinstall the app, or move it back yourself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n            在所有已挂载硬盘上都没有找到「%@」，更新缓存里也没有可恢复的新版本。\n\n            %@。请插入对应硬盘、重新安装该应用，或手动回迁。\n            "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已从更新缓存恢复「%@」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restored “%@” from the update cache"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已从更新缓存恢复「%@」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n            这个应用的更新曾中途失败（更新进程写外置盘被系统权限拒绝，应用本体被移走了）。\n            已把更新缓存里的新版本放回原位，链接已接通。\n\n            提示：这类失败与\"迁移/纯搬迁\"无关，是更新器写外置盘缺权限；\n            若再次发生，可先回迁内置盘完成更新，再迁移出去。\n            ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An update of this app failed halfway: the updater wasn’t allowed to write to the external drive, and the app itself was moved away. The newer build from the update cache is back in place, and the link works.\n\nThis isn’t caused by moving with or without a link. The updater didn’t have permission to write to the external drive. If it happens again, move the app back to the internal drive, update it, then move it out."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n            这个应用的更新曾中途失败（更新进程写外置盘被系统权限拒绝，应用本体被移走了）。\n            已把更新缓存里的新版本放回原位，链接已接通。\n\n            提示：这类失败与\"迁移/纯搬迁\"无关，是更新器写外置盘缺权限；\n            若再次发生，可先回迁内置盘完成更新，再迁移出去。\n            "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」正在运行": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is running"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」正在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要完全退出 App 才能继续。可以让我帮你退出（未保存的内容会先弹 App 自己的保存框），也可以你自己按 ⌘Q 退出后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has to quit completely before this can continue. Suishouqian can quit it for you (you’ll get the app’s own save dialog for unsaved work), or you can press ⌘Q and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要完全退出 App 才能继续。可以让我帮你退出（未保存的内容会先弹 App 自己的保存框），也可以你自己按 ⌘Q 退出后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
