    "已更新，搬回去": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updated — Move It Back"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已更新，搬回去"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」自带更新器。点「打开 App 检查更新」，在 App 内完成更新后完全退出 App（⌘Q），回到这里点「已更新，搬回去」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has its own updater. Click “Open the App and Check for Updates”, finish the update inside the app, quit it completely (⌘Q), then come back and click “Updated — Move It Back”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」自带更新器。点「打开 App 检查更新」，在 App 内完成更新后完全退出 App（⌘Q），回到这里点「已更新，搬回去」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去官网下载「%@」的新版 DMG，覆盖安装到「应用程序」里的版本（已在内置盘）。完成后完全退出 App（⌘Q），回到这里点「已更新，搬回去」。\n\n也可以先打开 App 看看有没有「检查更新」菜单。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download a new DMG of “%@” from the developer’s site and install it over the copy in Applications (it’s on the internal drive). Quit the app completely (⌘Q), then come back and click “Updated — Move It Back”.\n\nYou can also open the app and look for a Check for Updates command."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去官网下载「%@」的新版 DMG，覆盖安装到「应用程序」里的版本（已在内置盘）。完成后完全退出 App（⌘Q），回到这里点「已更新，搬回去」。\n\n也可以先打开 App 看看有没有「检查更新」菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
