    "会话记录会被删除。App 现在留在「应用程序」（内置盘），之后想搬回外置盘可以用列表里的「迁移」或「纯搬迁」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The session will be deleted. The app stays in Applications on the internal drive. To move it out later, use Move or Move Without Link in the list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话记录会被删除。App 现在留在「应用程序」（内置盘），之后想搬回外置盘可以用列表里的「迁移」或「纯搬迁」。"
          }
