    "更新助手进行中：「%@」已在内置盘等待更新，更新完成后在这里点搬回去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update helper: “%@” is on the internal drive waiting for you to update it. When you’re done, move it back from this row."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新助手进行中：「%@」已在内置盘等待更新，更新完成后在这里点搬回去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n                迁移：把应用搬到外置盘，并在「应用程序」里留一个链接。\n\n                应用仍会出现在「应用程序」文件夹里，双击、卸载（拖到废纸篓）都和以前一样；\n                启动时链接会被解析到外置盘；自带更新器就地更新（若某次更新后应用不见了，\n                去体检页「从更新缓存恢复」）。\n                ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move: puts the app on an external drive and leaves a link in Applications.\n\nThe app still appears in Applications. Double-click and drag-to-Trash work as before. Launching follows the link to the external drive. A built-in updater updates it in place. If the app disappears after an update, use “Recover from Update Cache” in Health."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n                迁移：把应用搬到外置盘，并在「应用程序」里留一个链接。\n\n                应用仍会出现在「应用程序」文件夹里，双击、卸载（拖到废纸篓）都和以前一样；\n                启动时链接会被解析到外置盘；自带更新器就地更新（若某次更新后应用不见了，\n                去体检页「从更新缓存恢复」）。\n                "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "纯搬迁": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Without Link"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纯搬迁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n                纯搬迁：把应用搬到外置盘，但不在「应用程序」文件夹留链接。\n\n                好处是从机制上消除\"更新把链接顶掉、迁移被悄悄撤销\"这个问题——\n                应用就住在它自己的位置，自带更新器会就地更新。\n\n                代价：应用不再出现在「应用程序」里，改用 Spotlight / Dock 启动。\n\n                适合：看不出更新方式的应用，或曾经被更新顶掉过迁移的应用。\n                ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Without Link: puts the app on an external drive and does not leave a link in Applications.\n\nThat removes the failure where an update replaces the link and quietly undoes the move. The app lives where it is, and its updater writes there.\n\nThe cost: it no longer appears in Applications. Launch it from Spotlight or the Dock.\n\nUse this when you can’t tell how the app updates, or when an update has already undone a move."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n                纯搬迁：把应用搬到外置盘，但不在「应用程序」文件夹留链接。\n\n                好处是从机制上消除\"更新把链接顶掉、迁移被悄悄撤销\"这个问题——\n                应用就住在它自己的位置，自带更新器会就地更新。\n\n                代价：应用不再出现在「应用程序」里，改用 Spotlight / Dock 启动。\n\n                适合：看不出更新方式的应用，或曾经被更新顶掉过迁移的应用。\n                "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用移入废纸篓（可恢复），并顺带排查它在资源库留下的数据": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move the app to the Trash (you can restore it) and look for data it left in Library"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用移入废纸篓（可恢复），并顺带排查它在资源库留下的数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
