    "更新助手：把 App 搬回内置盘，你更新完再一键搬回去。\n适合在外置盘上无法自动更新的应用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update helper: moves the app back to the internal drive so you can update it, then moves it out again.\nUseful when an app can’t update itself on an external drive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新助手：把 App 搬回内置盘，你更新完再一键搬回去。\n适合在外置盘上无法自动更新的应用。"
