    "盘间迁移：把应用从当前外置盘直接搬到另一块外置盘，不经过内置盘中转。\n目标盘空间不足或离线时不会出现在列表里。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move between drives: move the app from one external drive to another without copying it through the internal drive.\nDrives that are offline or don’t have enough space aren’t listed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "盘间迁移：把应用从当前外置盘直接搬到另一块外置盘，不经过内置盘中转。\n目标盘空间不足或离线时不会出现在列表里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用更新助手更新「%@」？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update “%@” with the update helper?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用更新助手更新「%@」？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "随手迁会先把 App 搬回「应用程序」（内置盘）。\n\n然后你去更新它（自带更新器 / 官网下载新版），更新完点「搬回去」，随手迁再把它搬回外置盘原来的位置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suishouqian first moves the app back to Applications on the internal drive.\n\nYou update it there (its own updater, or a new download). When you’re done, click Move Back Out and Suishouqian returns it to the same place on the external drive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随手迁会先把 App 搬回「应用程序」（内置盘）。\n\n然后你去更新它（自带更新器 / 官网下载新版），更新完点「搬回去」，随手迁再把它搬回外置盘原来的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
