    "\n        应用本体与迁移备份将移入废纸篓（可恢复），台账同步清理。\n        卸载完成后还会帮你排查它在「资源库」里留下的数据，由你确认后再清。\n        ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app and its move backup will go to the Trash, where you can restore them. The move log is updated. Afterward, Suishouqian looks for data left in Library and asks before removing it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        应用本体与迁移备份将移入废纸篓（可恢复），台账同步清理。\n        卸载完成后还会帮你排查它在「资源库」里留下的数据，由你确认后再清。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
