            "value": "Suishouqian needs these permissions to move apps, move them back, and uninstall them. Grant them once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随手迁需要以下权限才能迁移、回迁和卸载应用。配一次，后面不再打扰。"
          }
