    "用于扫描桌面/文稿/下载的大文件。未授予时「扩展扫描」不可用，卸载也可能因权限不足失败（如截图中的错误）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used to scan Desktop, Documents, and Downloads for large files. Without it, extended scan is unavailable, and uninstall can fail for lack of permission."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于扫描桌面/文稿/下载的大文件。未授予时「扩展扫描」不可用，卸载也可能因权限不足失败（如截图中的错误）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "修改其他应用（App Management）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
