    },
    "迁移/回迁/卸载都要改动 /Applications；不授予会反复弹「想要修改其他应用程序」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving, moving back, and uninstalling all change Applications. Without this, macOS keeps asking to modify other apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "迁移/回迁/卸载都要改动 /Applications；不授予会反复弹「想要修改其他应用程序」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "管理员密码": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Administrator password"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理员密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移系统自带 root 应用（如 Xcode 命令行工具）时仍会要一次管理员密码。这是安全设计，无法也不应绕过。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving a root-owned system app, such as the Xcode command-line tools, still asks for an administrator password once. That’s intentional and shouldn’t be bypassed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "迁移系统自带 root 应用（如 Xcode 命令行工具）时仍会要一次管理员密码。这是安全设计，无法也不应绕过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
