    "弹出外置盘前自动检查：有应用正从该盘运行、或迁移正在搬该盘时拦下弹出并提醒，其余弹出不打扰": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before an external drive ejects, block it if an app is running from that drive or a move is copying an app off it. Other ejects are left alone."
