    "应用自带更新器会把软链接换回真目录；开启后启动/插盘时自动检测并重迁（App Store 应用需手动）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some updaters replace the symbolic link with a real folder. When this is on, startup and drive connect detect that and move the app again. App Store apps stay manual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用自带更新器会把软链接换回真目录；开启后启动/插盘时自动检测并重迁（App Store 应用需手动）"
