    "默认只扫「资源库」零权限弹窗；开启前请先在「权限」页签授予完全磁盘访问权限": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default only Library is scanned, so macOS doesn’t ask for permission. Grant Full Disk Access on the Privacy tab before turning this on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认只扫「资源库」零权限弹窗；开启前请先在「权限」页签授予完全磁盘访问权限"
          }
