    "放另一块外置盘：盘体物理损坏时应用与备份不同时丢失。只影响新备份；指定盘离线自动回退同盘": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put backups on a different external drive so a dead disk doesn’t take the app and the backup together. Only new backups are affected. If that drive is offline, backups fall back to the same disk as the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放另一块外置盘：盘体物理损坏时应用与备份不同时丢失。只影响新备份；指定盘离线自动回退同盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与应用同盘": {
